WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:10.010
[theme music]

00:32.449 --> 00:35.160
[breathing heavily]

00:39.080 --> 00:40.874
[horn honking]

01:07.525 --> 01:09.652
[breathes heavily]

01:13.448 --> 01:14.491
This is safe.

01:18.703 --> 01:19.537
[sniffs]

01:26.753 --> 01:27.754
Go on.

01:28.755 --> 01:30.882
[Taeju] Sir, will you be okay on your own?

01:33.676 --> 01:36.805
- [retreating footsteps]
- [car door opens]

01:36.888 --> 01:37.931
[car door closes]

01:39.140 --> 01:41.142
[engine revving]

01:44.354 --> 01:46.523
[dramatic music]

01:50.276 --> 01:51.402
[gunshots]

01:51.486 --> 01:52.487
[groans]

01:53.279 --> 01:54.322
[chokes]

02:01.538 --> 02:03.665
[Mujin breathing heavily]

02:08.503 --> 02:10.713
[groaning]

02:11.673 --> 02:13.633
[panting]

02:18.596 --> 02:20.849
[somber music]

02:35.113 --> 02:35.947
[gun thuds]

02:36.948 --> 02:37.949
[sighs]

02:51.087 --> 02:53.965
[chanting]

03:04.726 --> 03:08.646
[approaching footsteps]

03:10.398 --> 03:11.733
[bell chimes]

03:15.236 --> 03:17.488
[breathing heavily]

03:24.996 --> 03:26.998
[Mujin groaning]

03:29.709 --> 03:30.793
[grunts]

03:32.337 --> 03:33.963
[gasping]

03:35.590 --> 03:37.634
[suspenseful music]

03:42.722 --> 03:43.723
[groans]

03:43.806 --> 03:46.142
[breathes heavily]

03:54.400 --> 03:56.945
[bell chiming]

03:57.570 --> 03:58.655
[groans]

04:14.128 --> 04:17.090
[breathes heavily]

04:20.385 --> 04:22.804
[panting]

04:25.223 --> 04:27.392
[water sloshing]

04:30.395 --> 04:32.021
[gasping]

04:36.734 --> 04:38.987
[metal clanking]

04:45.368 --> 04:48.955
[Gangjae laughs hysterically]

04:49.038 --> 04:50.081
[gasps]

04:52.583 --> 04:54.585
[grunting]

04:56.337 --> 04:57.839
- [Jiwoo yelps]
- [snickers]

04:59.924 --> 05:01.759
How does it feel to be a killer?

05:01.843 --> 05:03.386
[gasping]

05:04.554 --> 05:05.471
Shh.

05:08.808 --> 05:11.102
[panting]

05:13.313 --> 05:15.648
[tense music]

05:18.776 --> 05:19.902
[chokes]

05:20.903 --> 05:22.572
[Gangjae shushing]

05:22.655 --> 05:23.614
[grunts]

05:25.033 --> 05:26.326
[Gangjae] And you will…

05:27.368 --> 05:28.661
never ever…

05:29.579 --> 05:30.705
be able…

05:31.247 --> 05:33.249
- [groans]
- …to forget me.

05:35.460 --> 05:37.170
[grunts]

05:39.130 --> 05:41.507
[gasping]

05:42.300 --> 05:44.177
[panting]

05:48.389 --> 05:50.600
[panting continues]

06:05.031 --> 06:07.825
[breathing heavily]

06:12.413 --> 06:13.373
[exhales deeply]

06:25.718 --> 06:26.969
[doorbell rings]

06:28.096 --> 06:30.139
[tranquil music]

06:52.453 --> 06:53.496
[door lock beeps]

06:56.040 --> 06:57.750
[Jiwoo] Do I need to go now
for questioning?

07:00.461 --> 07:02.088
[plastic rustles]

07:02.672 --> 07:03.673
Wanna drink?

07:16.269 --> 07:17.645
First snowfall of the year.

07:19.105 --> 07:21.524
- [sniffs, exhales deeply]
- [door closes]

07:21.607 --> 07:23.192
- [Pildo] Can I come in?
- [door lock beeps]

07:24.652 --> 07:25.862
Have you eaten anything?

07:31.284 --> 07:32.535
Do you even eat?

07:47.967 --> 07:49.343
[Pildo sighs]
Jeez.

07:49.427 --> 07:51.345
The decor is very you.

07:55.850 --> 07:57.935
Tonight's not good.

08:01.731 --> 08:02.690
[bottles clink]

08:03.691 --> 08:05.026
So stuffy in here.

08:05.568 --> 08:08.196
[window blinds rattling]

08:09.071 --> 08:11.157
[Pildo] You shouldn't be alone
on a day like today.

08:15.328 --> 08:17.747
[rattling]

08:21.751 --> 08:22.710
[Pildo sighs]

08:24.045 --> 08:25.338
Do you like the snow?

08:30.343 --> 08:32.762
[inhales sharply]
You always avoid answering.

08:34.722 --> 08:36.432
What things do you like?

08:36.516 --> 08:38.726
Don't you have any hobbies?

08:40.645 --> 08:43.189
Now your fridge tells me
cooking is not one of them.

08:46.859 --> 08:47.944
No, I don't.

08:50.321 --> 08:52.281
Well, then what fun is life?

08:54.158 --> 08:55.993
Is life supposed to be fun?

08:58.955 --> 08:59.997
[sighs]

09:01.874 --> 09:03.668
You're so frustrating.

09:03.751 --> 09:06.128
No hobbies? You should make some.

09:06.212 --> 09:09.090
People in our line of work
need to take a break.

09:09.173 --> 09:11.175
Relax and not think sometimes.

09:15.513 --> 09:17.056
Beaches are nice.

09:19.475 --> 09:20.518
I like being there.

09:21.602 --> 09:22.603
Oh.

09:25.273 --> 09:26.232
Well…

09:26.941 --> 09:30.319
It would be beautiful to look
at the ocean on a day like this.

09:32.863 --> 09:34.282
Should we go now?

09:35.241 --> 09:37.118
You'll lose your license if we go now.

09:37.201 --> 09:38.369
[soft chuckle]

09:39.829 --> 09:42.081
We'll go another day, all right?

09:43.416 --> 09:45.001
I'm a really good fisherman.

09:45.084 --> 09:47.503
You'll never want restaurant sushi again.

09:47.587 --> 09:48.796
I swear it.

09:53.134 --> 09:54.844
[Jiwoo] There's no need to try so hard.

10:01.058 --> 10:02.143
I'm fine.

10:05.187 --> 10:07.315
[somber music]

10:14.989 --> 10:16.240
No, you're not.

10:19.160 --> 10:20.453
You and Do Gangjae…

10:22.079 --> 10:23.581
you knew each other, right?

10:25.166 --> 10:28.377
I heard him at the junkyard
before I passed out.

10:29.795 --> 10:31.172
The way he said your name.

10:38.179 --> 10:40.222
[somber music continues]

10:45.144 --> 10:47.188
He tried to rape me a long time ago.

10:49.273 --> 10:50.691
He drugged me first.

10:58.949 --> 11:00.451
I got this scar…

11:02.912 --> 11:05.331
when I tried to wake myself up
from the drug.

11:13.422 --> 11:15.049
[Pildo] So it was Do Gangjae.

11:18.177 --> 11:19.845
The one you wanted to catch.

11:33.859 --> 11:35.861
[somber music continues]

11:43.202 --> 11:44.245
[sighs]

12:06.350 --> 12:08.978
[somber music continues]

12:50.561 --> 12:51.979
[bell chiming]

12:54.231 --> 12:56.275
- [bell chiming continues]
- [broom stick rustling]

13:06.786 --> 13:07.995
[sighs]

13:15.920 --> 13:17.880
[groans]

13:30.559 --> 13:34.396
[monk] I thought I wouldn't see you again
until after we die, but here we are.

13:37.525 --> 13:40.236
You still living your life
fighting all the time?

13:41.737 --> 13:43.322
No choice in the matter

13:44.865 --> 13:46.408
if I want to survive.

13:49.620 --> 13:51.288
Life is a battle.

13:54.625 --> 13:56.919
[monk] You can't lose
and you can't give in.

13:57.002 --> 13:58.712
That's why it's a war.

14:03.342 --> 14:05.344
How else am I supposed to live?

14:08.055 --> 14:09.807
Are there people you can trust?

14:15.312 --> 14:16.397
[monk] That's good then.

14:17.314 --> 14:18.816
Rest here for a few days.

14:22.486 --> 14:25.281
[broom stick rustling]

14:30.995 --> 14:32.204
[sighs]

14:36.417 --> 14:37.459
[Cha Giho] Attention.

14:41.088 --> 14:44.049
These are the possible routes
Choi Mujin could've taken.

14:45.801 --> 14:48.095
Find out if anyone
within a two-mile radius

14:48.178 --> 14:50.180
is associated with Dongcheon.

14:50.264 --> 14:52.016
He had to have gotten treated.

14:52.099 --> 14:53.809
Check with every hospital, every vet,

14:53.893 --> 14:56.061
and retired doctor in the area.
Understood?

14:56.145 --> 14:57.313
[detectives] Yes, sir.

15:02.401 --> 15:03.360
[Cha Giho] Choi Mujin!

15:05.279 --> 15:06.196
[gunshot]

15:07.114 --> 15:10.576
[panting]

15:13.829 --> 15:15.456
[Daesoo] Hey. It's me.

15:15.539 --> 15:18.167
Can I get all the documents
on that car with the fake plate?

15:18.959 --> 15:21.045
Call me when they're ready.
I'll pick 'em up.

15:21.879 --> 15:22.796
Okay.

15:32.431 --> 15:33.682
[doorbell rings]

15:43.400 --> 15:47.404
JIWOO

15:54.203 --> 15:56.580
[ominous music]

16:07.758 --> 16:09.885
[tense music]

16:29.029 --> 16:31.657
SONG JOONSU

16:32.366 --> 16:33.993
Song Joonsu…

16:34.535 --> 16:35.744
[Jiwoo] Who is Song Joonsu?

16:35.828 --> 16:38.330
He died shortly after joining Narcotics.

16:40.624 --> 16:42.835
You don't know anything.

16:43.502 --> 16:46.588
SENDER
DO GANGJAE

16:46.672 --> 16:49.091
[cell phone vibrating]

16:52.177 --> 16:53.178
[Mujin] Jiwoo.

16:53.887 --> 16:55.556
I'm going to stay here tonight.

16:55.639 --> 16:56.890
Meet me here.

16:59.393 --> 17:02.312
IF ANYTHING HAPPENS TO ME…

17:07.776 --> 17:08.777
[sighs]

17:17.828 --> 17:19.997
[tense music]

17:26.295 --> 17:27.254
[Pildo] What's up here?

17:27.337 --> 17:30.007
It's a factory
that processes forest products.

17:36.722 --> 17:37.973
And over there?

17:38.057 --> 17:40.684
[officer] There is a small temple
on Cheonwang Mountain.

17:47.524 --> 17:48.692
[monk] It's ready.

17:51.403 --> 17:53.697
[owl hooting]

18:11.590 --> 18:14.343
[Jiwoo panting]

18:25.229 --> 18:26.355
Sit down.

18:29.483 --> 18:30.484
[sniffs]

18:32.069 --> 18:33.403
How are you feeling?

18:35.989 --> 18:37.157
[Mujin] It hurts.

18:38.909 --> 18:40.452
I haven't been stabbed in a while.

18:40.536 --> 18:41.411
It hurts.

18:43.455 --> 18:44.832
I had forgotten…

18:44.915 --> 18:46.083
[inhales sharply]

18:47.126 --> 18:48.794
…just how much it hurts.

18:53.382 --> 18:55.551
Do Gangjae sent me a photo.

19:01.181 --> 19:04.518
[Jiwoo] The Song Joonsu
that they said died 17 years ago…

19:09.064 --> 19:10.899
My father was a cop?

19:11.567 --> 19:13.569
[dramatic music]

19:21.577 --> 19:22.578
Yes.

19:24.371 --> 19:25.873
Donghoon was a cop.

19:28.083 --> 19:29.376
Cha Giho had sent him.

19:30.502 --> 19:32.421
He wanted to take us down from inside.

19:35.007 --> 19:36.675
But Donghoon flipped on him.

19:37.509 --> 19:38.802
Came to our side.

19:41.305 --> 19:42.764
Like I told you before…

19:45.058 --> 19:46.894
Your father saved my life.

19:55.611 --> 19:56.737
Let's go in.

20:08.916 --> 20:11.084
[dramatic music continues]

20:41.823 --> 20:43.116
YOON DONGHOON

20:43.200 --> 20:45.244
[Jiwoo] I didn't even know my dad's name.

20:47.996 --> 20:49.081
Two lives.

20:52.334 --> 20:53.710
Two names.

20:57.589 --> 21:00.676
So that's why he looked like
he was on the edge of a cliff.

21:06.598 --> 21:08.308
That's how you look now.

21:11.979 --> 21:13.689
Do you feel on the edge?

21:16.608 --> 21:18.235
Whenever he had time,

21:19.027 --> 21:21.029
he'd disappear somewhere by himself.

21:22.948 --> 21:24.700
I assumed it was a girl.

21:28.745 --> 21:29.746
One day,

21:30.539 --> 21:32.624
I happened to see him out on the street.

21:33.834 --> 21:35.252
I followed him.

21:36.670 --> 21:39.298
I was worried he was seeing someone shady.

21:43.385 --> 21:45.929
But I just turned around and I left.

21:49.182 --> 21:51.518
If she can make him smile like that,

21:52.519 --> 21:54.563
it didn't matter who she was.

21:57.107 --> 21:58.483
I found out later…

22:01.028 --> 22:02.279
that it was you.

22:08.035 --> 22:09.703
Your dad is Yoon Donghoon.

22:11.121 --> 22:13.498
He lived and died with the organization.

22:15.584 --> 22:16.585
Jiwoo.

22:17.169 --> 22:18.420
Don't get weak.

22:20.213 --> 22:22.299
And don't ever forget how you got here.

22:25.510 --> 22:27.220
Why did you hide it from me?

22:30.724 --> 22:32.476
Because you need conviction

22:33.518 --> 22:34.895
to be a killer.

22:38.023 --> 22:40.484
I wanted you to find the answer yourself.

22:50.786 --> 22:52.871
[dramatic music continues]

23:05.258 --> 23:06.343
Jiwoo.

23:09.096 --> 23:10.972
What more is there to confirm?

23:13.517 --> 23:14.518
Or…

23:16.645 --> 23:18.397
are you hesitating?

23:32.452 --> 23:33.453
[Pildo] Can you tell me…

23:34.246 --> 23:35.622
Have you seen this man?

23:36.832 --> 23:39.584
No one has visited us for a while.

23:40.502 --> 23:42.504
[bell chiming]

23:48.677 --> 23:51.972
[monk] People don't come to temples much
when the weather gets cold.

23:53.223 --> 23:55.100
[cell phone vibrates]

23:57.978 --> 23:58.937
[Pildo] Hello?

24:03.733 --> 24:04.818
Where are you?

24:06.111 --> 24:08.530
[bell chiming]

24:13.618 --> 24:16.163
[breathes heavily]

24:26.381 --> 24:28.091
[Jiwoo] Was Dongcheon involved?

24:28.175 --> 24:30.010
Dongcheon killed him.

24:30.594 --> 24:32.888
Cha Giho couldn't accept his betrayal

24:35.098 --> 24:36.433
and killed your father.

24:37.767 --> 24:39.269
Those assholes can die.

24:42.439 --> 24:44.441
[engine starts]

24:50.739 --> 24:52.574
What about Do Gangjae?

24:53.241 --> 24:55.535
Don't we need to find Mujin?

24:55.619 --> 24:57.287
There is no evidence.

24:57.370 --> 24:58.997
That makes no sense.

24:59.789 --> 25:02.375
At least we can try to investigate.

25:02.459 --> 25:04.419
What are we going to do now?

25:06.463 --> 25:07.923
Yoon Donghoon…

25:10.258 --> 25:11.968
[fireworks crackle]

25:13.970 --> 25:15.013
[bar owner] Come on in.

25:19.392 --> 25:20.393
Captain.

25:21.353 --> 25:22.687
Oh, hi.

25:24.523 --> 25:25.607
Do you want soju?

25:25.690 --> 25:26.775
[chair scrapes]

25:27.442 --> 25:28.527
It's all burnt.

25:30.487 --> 25:31.530
[Cha Giho] I won't…

25:33.323 --> 25:34.407
be able…

25:37.410 --> 25:39.996
to fall asleep if I'm sober tonight.

25:42.541 --> 25:44.960
[exhales deeply]

25:45.585 --> 25:46.711
Let me.

25:52.050 --> 25:53.176
[Cha Giho] Pildo.

25:54.386 --> 25:57.389
What would you do
if you found your sister's killer?

26:00.308 --> 26:02.435
[inhales sharply]
Put him away.

26:03.019 --> 26:04.354
And if there's no evidence?

26:07.023 --> 26:08.525
You find him and there's no…

26:08.608 --> 26:09.526
[inhales sharply]

26:10.860 --> 26:12.237
No evidence.

26:14.990 --> 26:17.742
[fireworks crackling]

26:21.913 --> 26:23.206
[groans]

26:23.290 --> 26:24.666
[soju pouring]

26:24.749 --> 26:25.667
[Cha Giho burps]

26:28.545 --> 26:29.588
What if…

26:30.213 --> 26:31.923
you had the chance to kill the guy?

26:32.465 --> 26:34.551
No cameras, no witnesses.

26:34.634 --> 26:36.136
Nothing, but you!

26:38.972 --> 26:40.056
Then?

26:42.976 --> 26:46.313
Remember what you said
when I joined Narcotics?

26:50.859 --> 26:53.236
"Investigations are like sandcastles.

26:54.571 --> 26:56.156
You work hard to build it up,

26:56.698 --> 26:58.783
but the wave comes
and knocks it down constantly.

27:00.869 --> 27:04.873
But if you keep at it,
the low tide will come eventually.

27:07.125 --> 27:08.752
That's when you get your man."

27:09.294 --> 27:11.296
[gentle music]

27:15.467 --> 27:16.509
Choi Mujin.

27:18.053 --> 27:19.471
Won't be free long.

27:25.018 --> 27:26.061
That's not bad.

27:32.776 --> 27:34.152
I learned it from you.

27:35.570 --> 27:36.488
[chuckles]

27:41.993 --> 27:44.287
- Can I get a glass, please?
- [bar owner] Sure.

27:48.750 --> 27:49.793
Yes.

27:49.876 --> 27:50.794
[Mujin] Taeju.

27:51.836 --> 27:53.838
I don't think Jiwoo can finish the job.

27:56.633 --> 27:58.259
You get rid of Cha Giho.

28:04.641 --> 28:05.642
Yes, sir.

28:09.979 --> 28:12.982
YOON DONGHOON

28:38.007 --> 28:39.342
[engine stops]

28:39.426 --> 28:40.385
[seat belt clicks]

28:43.138 --> 28:45.223
[somber music]

29:01.448 --> 29:02.657
Just a minute.

29:04.617 --> 29:06.453
- [Pildo] Wait, wait. Careful.
- [Cha Giho groans]

29:15.128 --> 29:16.713
[door clanks open]

29:16.796 --> 29:19.090
[approaching footsteps]

29:26.973 --> 29:29.976
[buttons clicking]

29:32.812 --> 29:35.982
SECURITY GUARD BREAK TIMES

29:36.065 --> 29:37.400
[Cha Giho groans]

29:38.526 --> 29:39.486
We're here.

29:39.569 --> 29:40.904
- You're going off?
- [Cha Giho] Yes.

29:40.987 --> 29:43.281
- [groans]
- Careful. Careful.

29:43.364 --> 29:45.366
- [groans]
- Your head.

29:45.992 --> 29:47.702
Get up. You're home.

29:47.786 --> 29:49.913
- [groans]
- One, two, three.

29:50.747 --> 29:52.040
- [sighs]
- Where's your key?

29:52.665 --> 29:53.666
I have it.

29:54.167 --> 29:56.961
- Hey. Hey.
- I have it, so… so go.

29:57.962 --> 29:59.130
[groans]

29:59.214 --> 30:00.340
[sighs]

30:00.423 --> 30:01.424
[Cha Giho] Go, Pildo.

30:01.508 --> 30:02.926
- Just open it.
- [Cha Giho] I'm okay.

30:03.009 --> 30:04.052
- Just go.
- [keys rattle]

30:04.677 --> 30:05.553
Shit.

30:05.637 --> 30:07.263
- You want me to stay?
- [Cha Giho] Ah.

30:07.347 --> 30:09.599
- [groans]
- [keys rattling]

30:10.517 --> 30:11.434
[sighs]

30:12.101 --> 30:13.478
- [lock clicks]
- [groans]

30:15.688 --> 30:17.315
- [Pildo] Should I go?
- [Cha Giho] Yes, go.

30:18.691 --> 30:20.193
- [Pildo] Good night.
- [Cha Giho] Okay.

30:31.412 --> 30:32.413
[key thuds]

30:33.540 --> 30:34.624
[sighs]

30:48.429 --> 30:51.015
[approaching footsteps]

30:55.895 --> 30:58.398
- [grunting]
- [groaning]

31:01.234 --> 31:02.318
[Cha Giho groans]

31:04.529 --> 31:06.072
[bottles clinking]

31:06.155 --> 31:07.198
[bottle shatters]

31:07.282 --> 31:08.449
[grunts]

31:08.533 --> 31:11.202
[both grunting]

31:13.162 --> 31:16.332
[Taeju grunting]

31:17.750 --> 31:18.918
[gasping]

31:22.130 --> 31:23.965
[Taeju groaning]

31:24.549 --> 31:26.050
[Taeju panting]

31:27.719 --> 31:28.636
[Taeju groans]

31:39.606 --> 31:41.858
[suspenseful music]

31:43.484 --> 31:46.195
[approaching footsteps]

32:02.921 --> 32:04.005
[door lock clinks]

32:14.641 --> 32:15.558
[doorknob rattles]

32:28.571 --> 32:29.614
[lock clicks]

32:38.539 --> 32:39.415
[gunshot]

32:42.126 --> 32:44.295
[suspenseful music]

32:45.922 --> 32:47.298
[Cha Giho] Oh Hyejin.

32:47.382 --> 32:49.175
Choi Mujin's dog!

32:49.258 --> 32:50.843
[breathes heavily]

32:50.927 --> 32:52.887
Are you here to finish me?

32:53.388 --> 32:55.848
[Cha Giho breathes heavily]

32:55.932 --> 32:57.141
Drop the knife.

32:59.560 --> 33:01.562
Don't you see what's in my hand?

33:01.646 --> 33:03.272
[breathes heavily]

33:04.524 --> 33:06.067
Drop the knife.

33:08.611 --> 33:10.196
I came to ask you something.

33:12.323 --> 33:13.616
Ask something?

33:15.284 --> 33:17.620
You might die depending on the answer.

33:19.831 --> 33:20.999
[pants]

33:24.293 --> 33:26.295
My dad died because of you.

33:28.214 --> 33:30.717
But he never dropped his knife
until the moment he died.

33:30.800 --> 33:32.218
To protect me.

33:33.678 --> 33:36.556
I threw everything away
to catch this son of a bitch.

33:37.098 --> 33:38.224
[sobs]

33:44.856 --> 33:47.775
Tell me what you did to my dad
five years ago today.

33:47.859 --> 33:49.485
[breathes heavily]

33:50.069 --> 33:51.029
Tell me!

33:51.112 --> 33:53.114
[Jiwoo whimpers]

34:01.289 --> 34:02.665
Are you Jiwoo?

34:06.044 --> 34:07.170
Yoon Jiwoo?

34:10.173 --> 34:12.216
[breathes shakily]

34:15.970 --> 34:17.805
You remember the name.

34:19.974 --> 34:20.975
Why?

34:22.518 --> 34:24.062
Were you feeling guilty, huh?

34:26.064 --> 34:27.523
Donghoon… No.

34:30.234 --> 34:32.361
Joonsu was undercover.

34:34.697 --> 34:36.199
He was our agent--

34:36.282 --> 34:37.408
I know that.

34:39.994 --> 34:42.371
I know that you sent him
into the organization.

34:42.955 --> 34:45.666
And my father betrayed you,
so you decided to take his life?

34:47.043 --> 34:48.211
[Cha Giho] Song Jiwoo…

34:50.546 --> 34:52.090
How did you…

34:54.467 --> 34:56.636
end up working for Choi Mujin?

35:01.682 --> 35:03.101
Choi Mujin…

35:04.102 --> 35:06.062
That demon and cunning!

35:08.147 --> 35:10.274
[wailing]

35:13.778 --> 35:16.030
[wailing continues]

35:20.827 --> 35:22.203
[Pildo] Captain!

35:23.621 --> 35:25.039
Captain!

35:25.123 --> 35:27.250
- [groaning]
- [Pildo] Captain!

35:28.000 --> 35:29.043
- Captain!
- [whispers] Jiwoo.

35:30.336 --> 35:31.587
[Pildo] Captain!

35:32.672 --> 35:33.714
[Cha Giho] Jiwoo.

35:35.091 --> 35:36.425
[pants]

35:37.176 --> 35:38.636
[clanking]

35:39.178 --> 35:40.680
[groans]

35:40.763 --> 35:41.931
Captain!

35:46.060 --> 35:47.186
[Jiwoo groans]

35:48.479 --> 35:50.356
- [Pildo] Captain! Captain!
- [pants, groans]

35:53.860 --> 35:54.735
Captain!

36:02.201 --> 36:03.244
[groans]

36:05.955 --> 36:07.165
[exhales deeply]

36:13.629 --> 36:16.257
[breathes heavily]

36:24.557 --> 36:25.766
[Cha Giho] Get out of here.

36:29.437 --> 36:31.856
[siren blaring in distance]

36:47.246 --> 36:49.874
JUNG TAEJU
SECOND-IN-COMMAND

36:52.793 --> 36:54.295
[Donghoon] Taeju, you arrange them.

36:54.378 --> 36:55.296
[Taeju] Okay.

36:56.547 --> 36:57.798
You, step in.

36:57.882 --> 36:59.342
- Come on.
- Yes, sir.

36:59.842 --> 37:02.053
- [Donghoon] You won last year too, right?
- [gangster] That's right.

37:02.136 --> 37:03.512
- Two years in a row.
- [gangster chuckles]

37:03.596 --> 37:05.681
- Next time let someone else win.
- [laughter]

37:05.765 --> 37:06.641
- Yes, sir!
- Dongcheon!

37:06.724 --> 37:08.392
[gangsters] Dongcheon!

37:08.476 --> 37:10.311
- [camera shutter clicks]
- [lighter clinks]

37:10.394 --> 37:12.855
[siren blaring in distance]

37:15.274 --> 37:16.192
[clinks]

37:16.275 --> 37:17.276
[man grunts]

37:20.529 --> 37:22.782
[man grunting]

37:23.282 --> 37:25.701
[man groaning]

37:28.746 --> 37:29.705
[grunts]

37:31.290 --> 37:33.292
[panting]

37:35.836 --> 37:37.338
[clinking]

37:39.757 --> 37:44.095
["My Name" playing]

37:44.178 --> 37:45.721
[exhales deeply]

37:45.805 --> 37:47.556
[hissing]

37:47.640 --> 37:48.474
Yeah.

37:49.016 --> 37:50.226
- Take it easy, man.
- [grunts]

37:53.229 --> 37:54.146
[groans]

37:54.230 --> 37:55.356
Enough.

37:55.439 --> 37:56.440
That's enough.

38:01.862 --> 38:02.863
What is this?

38:04.615 --> 38:05.741
A gift for you.

38:09.036 --> 38:09.912
"Gift for you."

38:09.996 --> 38:11.831
- Isn't it great?
- [chuckles]

38:14.917 --> 38:15.918
Try it.

38:18.879 --> 38:20.506
Want me to die quickly?

38:20.589 --> 38:22.633
- You punk.
- [lighter clinks]

38:22.717 --> 38:24.176
Don't use disposable lighters.

38:24.260 --> 38:25.511
You're the boss. Look the part.

38:25.594 --> 38:26.929
It doesn't make a sound.

38:27.638 --> 38:29.473
- [lighter clinks]
- Yes, it does.

38:29.974 --> 38:31.767
[clicks]

38:33.561 --> 38:35.187
What sound did you expect?

38:39.692 --> 38:40.609
[moans]

38:41.235 --> 38:45.448
♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

38:47.366 --> 38:51.120
♪ Whoa, whoa ♪

38:51.203 --> 38:54.540
♪ Oh, whoa ♪

38:54.623 --> 38:57.585
[objects clattering]

38:59.253 --> 39:01.630
[clattering continues]

39:02.298 --> 39:04.550
[panting]

39:06.302 --> 39:08.304
[panting continues]

39:11.515 --> 39:14.477
♪ Oh-oh-oh ♪

39:15.186 --> 39:18.022
♪ Oh-oh-oh ♪

39:19.148 --> 39:21.650
♪ Oh-oh-oh ♪

39:22.818 --> 39:25.279
♪ Oh-oh-oh ♪

39:30.785 --> 39:31.827
[clanks]

39:48.344 --> 39:49.845
CHOI MUJIN, YOON DONGHOON,
AND 5 OTHERS

39:49.929 --> 39:51.055
VISIT DRUG FACTORY ON NOVEMBER 6

39:51.138 --> 39:53.724
[typewriter keys clacking]

39:53.808 --> 39:54.767
[typewriter dings]

39:56.811 --> 39:59.480
[upbeat music]

39:59.563 --> 40:02.149
[typewriter keys clacking]

40:02.233 --> 40:03.109
[dings]

40:05.152 --> 40:08.030
[typewriter keys clacking]

40:08.114 --> 40:13.119
PLANS TO HAVE LUNCH WITH JANG INCHEOL,
DIRECTOR OF INCHANG IMMIGRATION OFFICE

40:15.037 --> 40:16.497
69TH INTELLIGENCE REPORT

40:20.751 --> 40:22.169
364TH INTELLIGENCE REPORT

40:22.253 --> 40:23.754
413RD INTELLIGENCE REPORT

40:30.719 --> 40:31.720
[Cha Giho] Joonsu…

40:31.804 --> 40:35.141
[Cha Giho pants]
…was a cop until the day that he died.

40:35.766 --> 40:36.725
[breathes sharply]

40:37.435 --> 40:38.811
The proof is here.

40:39.728 --> 40:41.105
[pants]

40:41.689 --> 40:43.315
NOVEMBER 30, 2016

40:43.399 --> 40:46.735
[Donghoon] Happy birthday,
my dear daughter.

40:46.819 --> 40:47.778
Taeju.

40:47.862 --> 40:48.904
Get out of here.

40:50.823 --> 40:53.909
[car engine revving]

41:05.337 --> 41:07.923
[keys rattling]

41:08.007 --> 41:08.924
[gunshot]

41:10.926 --> 41:11.760
[gunshot]

41:19.977 --> 41:22.771
[soft guitar music]

41:29.695 --> 41:31.030
PUREUNSOL MEMORIAL PARK
MAINTENANCE RECEIPT

41:31.113 --> 41:32.448
NAME OF BURIED: KIM JEONGA

41:32.531 --> 41:34.283
NEXT OF KIN: SONG JOONSU

41:34.366 --> 41:35.951
RECIPIENT: CHA GIHO

41:36.035 --> 41:37.036
[Cha Giho] Jiwoo.

41:38.287 --> 41:41.081
IF ANYTHING HAPPENS TO ME
PLEASE GIVE TO JIWOO

41:41.165 --> 41:42.541
Thank you…

41:44.210 --> 41:45.920
[groans]

41:46.003 --> 41:47.213
…for being alive.

41:49.048 --> 41:51.133
IF ANYTHING HAPPENS TO ME
PLEASE GIVE TO JIWOO

41:57.723 --> 42:00.226
TO MY BELOVED DAUGHTER JIWOO

42:00.309 --> 42:02.436
[paper rustling]

42:02.520 --> 42:04.146
[breathes heavily]

42:10.444 --> 42:11.946
[whimpers]

42:13.614 --> 42:16.158
[sirens wailing]

42:29.004 --> 42:30.548
[sobbing]

42:31.507 --> 42:32.466
[Donghoon] Jiwoo.

42:34.260 --> 42:36.428
My daughter who grew up too quickly.

42:37.930 --> 42:40.599
There were so many things
I wanted to do with you.

42:43.394 --> 42:45.145
Whenever there's hardship,

42:45.229 --> 42:47.898
I want to talk, beg,
and tell you to trust me.

42:48.857 --> 42:50.776
If you fall in love,

42:51.360 --> 42:53.821
I want to worry about what he's like.

42:55.614 --> 42:59.451
I wanna watch you get married
and have children.

43:00.744 --> 43:03.414
I want to share all
of those days with you,

43:05.165 --> 43:06.458
but there's a chance…

43:07.209 --> 43:11.088
that those days may never come.

43:16.051 --> 43:17.886
I was an inadequate dad,

43:18.846 --> 43:21.432
but I was happy because of you, Jiwoo.

43:22.349 --> 43:23.851
You have to be happy

43:25.019 --> 43:28.814
and live a good life
even if I'm not around, okay?

43:29.648 --> 43:31.734
I'm sorry I can't be with you.

43:34.570 --> 43:35.821
I love you.

43:37.573 --> 43:40.159
[sentimental music]

43:40.242 --> 43:41.327
[Mujin] Your father…

43:43.037 --> 43:45.414
was my most trusted friend and brother.

43:45.497 --> 43:46.874
[panting]

43:47.625 --> 43:48.959
[Mujin] Do you have to…

43:49.043 --> 43:50.336
get revenge?

43:51.712 --> 43:53.464
Regardless of the price you pay?

43:53.547 --> 43:55.466
[Mujin] Here's the gun
that killed your dad.

43:57.259 --> 43:58.552
You're gonna find him.

43:59.136 --> 44:00.179
Kill him.

44:01.263 --> 44:04.266
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

44:04.350 --> 44:08.145
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

44:08.228 --> 44:10.773
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

44:10.856 --> 44:13.192
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

44:13.275 --> 44:15.361
Donghoon's killer is a policeman.

44:16.236 --> 44:17.946
[Mujin] I'm giving you my dagger.

44:18.030 --> 44:19.907
You kill him as soon as you can.

44:19.990 --> 44:21.492
Don't buy it.

44:23.160 --> 44:26.538
[Jiwoo] Chamomile tea.
It's supposed to help with insomnia.

44:35.005 --> 44:37.424
YOON DONGHOON

44:39.593 --> 44:41.512
[Mujin] Because you need conviction

44:42.471 --> 44:43.847
to be a killer.

44:43.931 --> 44:46.141
♪ Lay my head down ♪

44:46.225 --> 44:48.852
♪ And rest my mind ♪

44:48.936 --> 44:53.440
♪ Give up searching 'cause I cannot find ♪

44:53.524 --> 44:55.943
- ♪ The strength I need ♪
- [tires screech]

44:56.026 --> 45:02.449
♪ To keep on holding on ♪

45:03.784 --> 45:05.077
[coughs]

45:07.788 --> 45:10.249
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

45:10.332 --> 45:13.836
- ♪ A thought is haunting me… ♪
- [screams]

45:13.919 --> 45:15.003
[sobs]

45:17.589 --> 45:20.092
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

45:20.175 --> 45:23.595
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

45:23.679 --> 45:26.432
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

45:26.515 --> 45:28.892
[wailing]

45:32.312 --> 45:33.772
[yelling]

45:33.856 --> 45:37.151
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

45:37.234 --> 45:39.528
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

45:39.611 --> 45:42.448
[gasping]

45:43.323 --> 45:49.538
♪ What the hell is evеn going on? ♪

45:49.621 --> 45:51.957
[screaming]

45:53.208 --> 45:57.004
[screaming continues]

45:57.087 --> 45:59.715
[panting]

46:00.299 --> 46:02.885
[muffled scream]

46:02.968 --> 46:07.055
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

46:07.139 --> 46:09.683
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

46:09.767 --> 46:12.936
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

46:14.480 --> 46:17.566
[breathing heavily]

46:20.068 --> 46:22.529
[coughing]

46:23.113 --> 46:26.867
♪ Every moment, every day ♪

46:26.950 --> 46:29.495
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

46:29.578 --> 46:33.248
- ♪ A thought is haunting me… ♪
- [breathing heavily]

46:35.876 --> 46:38.003
[siren wailing in distance]

46:40.798 --> 46:41.632
[Pildo] Captain…

46:42.549 --> 46:43.801
Hold on for me.

46:45.177 --> 46:47.262
[machine beeping]

46:52.059 --> 46:53.227
[car door closes]

47:07.199 --> 47:09.201
[upbeat music]

47:11.286 --> 47:13.288
[frizzling]

47:19.670 --> 47:23.590
[sizzling]

47:23.674 --> 47:27.761
♪ I was alone I just couldn't be found ♪

47:27.845 --> 47:31.890
♪ I want my life to be ordinary ♪

47:31.974 --> 47:33.684
♪ I was alone ♪

47:33.767 --> 47:35.686
♪ I just couldn't be found ♪

47:35.769 --> 47:37.980
♪ No more ♪

47:38.063 --> 47:39.356
♪ No more ♪

